<title>JAPAN: Indonesia May Minas calculated $18.77/bbl--traders.</title>
<headline>Indonesia May Minas calculated $18.77/bbl--traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of Indonesia's main Minas crude oil for May lifting was calculated at $18.77 per barrel, up 49 cents from April, traders said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Prices of other grades are as follows:</p>
<p>    TYPE		  MAY	     APRIL</p>
<p> Ardjuna		  19.28	   18.81</p>
<p> Arun Condensate	19.34	   18.98</p>
<p> Attaka		   19.96	   19.59</p>
<p> Cinta		    17.99	   17.51</p>
<p> Duri		     16.95	   16.62</p>
<p> Handil		   18.77	   18.28</p>
<p> Lalang		   18.82	   18.33</p>
<p> Widuri		   17.88	   17.41</p>
<p> Belida		   19.93	   19.61</p>
<p> Anoa		     20.36	   19.99</p>
<p> Badak		    19.96	   19.59</p>
<p> Bekapai		  19.96	   19.59</p>
<p> Bunyu		    18.47	   17.98</p>
<p> Jatibarang	     17.76	   17.27</p>
<p> Bontang Mix	    19.14	   18.78</p>
<p> Walio		    18.57	   18.08</p>
